      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moscow%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Rev. Peter Rupert, a Lutheran minister, built the first log house in 1830 and is credited with founding the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
